# Qualification consumer graph: fixtures/valid-work.ttl's CS2-WRK-003 plus a
# dependent CS2-WRK-006 under one source binding, grouped as one WorkBatch.
# Rendered by `ggen sync run` through every templates/**/*.tmpl; the pack gates
# (010-095) must admit it.
